{'symbol': 'CCL', 'date': '2022-03-01 08:00:00', 'title': 'CARNIVAL CRUISE LINE REVEALS ADDITIONAL ITINERARIES INTO 2024 RELATED TO SHIP REASSIGNMENTS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED', 'text': 'MIAMI, MARCH 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CARNIVAL CRUISE LINE CONTINUES TO IMPLEMENT ITS SHIP DEPLOYMENT CHANGES ANNOUNCED EARLIER IN FEBRUARY, WITH SHIP AND HOMEPORT ASSIGNMENTS EXTENDED INTO 2023 AND 2024, INCLUDING: CARNIVAL ELATION – JACKSONVILLE CARNIVAL ELATION, PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED AS MOVING TO JACKSONVILLE, FLA., WILL CONTINUE SERVICE OF 4- AND 5-DAY SAILINGS FORMERLY ASSIGNED TO CARNIVAL ECSTASY.'}